# INVWINJB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the notes of the
# assembly commands at level 2 (CLERK), on the status bar's help panel,
# as INV's hint row shows them.  Move moves item 2 to A1, noted "Item 2
# moved to A1", which the next key ends.  Install in installs item 3 in
# item 1, noted "Item 3 installed in item 1", and Take out takes it out
# to B2, noted "Item 3 taken out to B2".  Take out again is refused, as
# item 3 is in no assembly, and leaving the dialog then notes nothing.
# In item 1's parts, opened by Parts, INS installs item 3, noted "Item 3
# installed in item 1", and Take out takes it out to A1, noted "Item 3
# taken out to A1".  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINJB.SNP is
# its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER DOWN ALT-C M
T A1
K ENTER
S MOVED
K DOWN
S ENDED
K ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER
S INSTALL
K ALT-C T
T B2
K ENTER
S OUT
K ALT-C T
T B2
K ENTER
S NOTIN
K ESC
S NONOTE
K HOME ALT-C P INS
T 3
K ENTER
S PARTIN
K ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S PARTOUT
K ESC ALT-F X
